# DXFvec Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your keys.

```ini
# ============================================
# Server / Web UI
# ============================================
PORT=5000
FLASK_DEBUG=0
MAX_IMAGE_DIM=2048
DOWNLOAD_TTL=3600

# ============================================
# LLM Providers (LiteLLM reads .env automatically)
# ============================================
# Fallback chain used by --provider:
#   google → openrouter → groq → mistral → openai → cerebras → cohere → nvidia → xai
#
# Set only the keys you actually use. Uncomment the lines you need.

# Google Gemini (default LLM provider)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# OpenAI
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Anthropic
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Groq
# GROQ_API_KEY=

# Mistral
# MISTRAL_API_KEY=

# Cerebras
# CEREBRAS_API_KEY=

# Cohere
# COHERE_API_KEY=

# NVIDIA NIM
# NVIDIA_API_KEY=

# xAI / Grok
# XAI_API_KEY=

# OpenRouter (multi-provider gateway)
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Ollama (local LLM — no key required, ensure server is running)
# OLLAMA_API_KEY=

# ============================================
# Cloud AI Engines (BYOK)
# ============================================
# Vectorizer.AI
# DXVEC_VECTORIZER_AI_API_ID=
# DXVEC_VECTORIZER_AI_API_SECRET=

# DXFai (placeholder — API not publicly documented)
# DXVEC_DXFAI_API_KEY=

# ============================================
# Docker runtime
# ============================================
PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1
PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1
PYTHONPATH=/app/src
```
